{"type":"standard","title":"Horpa language","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Horpa language</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q56854","titles":{"canonical":"Horpa_language","normalized":"Horpa language","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Horpa language</span></span>"},"pageid":33244994,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Horpa_map.jpg/330px-Horpa_map.jpg","width":330,"height":271},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/Horpa_map.jpg","width":1290,"height":1059},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1355141347","tid":"9dd55b8f-53fe-11f1-b4bd-eadc1fedb859","timestamp":"2026-05-20T03:47:26Z","description":"Rgyalrongic language of China","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horpa_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horpa_language?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horpa_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Horpa_language"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horpa_language","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Horpa_language","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Horpa_language?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Horpa_language"}},"extract":"Horpa are a cluster of closely related Gyalrongic languages of China. Horpa is better understood as a cluster of closely related yet unintelligible dialect groups/languages. Its main dialects include Stau, Nyagrong Minyag, Stodsde, Geshiza, Bawang, etc.","extract_html":"<p><b>Horpa</b> are a cluster of closely related Gyalrongic languages of China. Horpa is better understood as a cluster of closely related yet unintelligible dialect groups/languages. Its main dialects include Stau, Nyagrong Minyag, Stodsde, Geshiza, Bawang, etc.</p>"}